    "2 tablespoons canned pumpkin puree",
    "2 tablespoons white sugar",
    "1 teaspoon vanilla extract",
    "0.25 teaspoon pumpkin pie spice",
    "1 (1.5 fluid ounce) jigger brewed espresso"
